      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "I would also very much like to send notifications into VRChat over OSC. \nAs a developer I currently have 3 options for giving my users ingame notifications, none of which are exactly ideal:\n1. Use XSOverlay's Notification API (Requires the player to purchase XSOverlay)\n2. Send a desktop notification and have it display through OVR Toolkit (Requires the player to purchase OVR Toolkit and configure it to show desktop notifications)\n3. Implement my own SteamVR overlay, just for showing notifications.\nIt would be great if external applications (e.g. VRCX offering all 3 methods) would not have to rely on methods like these just to get notifications to the user. \nBeing able to send notifications over OSC would be a solution.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
